  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 36-layer planar dielectric filter on fused silica substrate with air incidence at 0 degrees, unpolarized light. Stack structure: alternating Ta2O5 (Gao) and SiO2 (Gao) layers, starting with Ta2O5 (Gao), ending with SiO2 (Gao) before substrate (18 pairs total). All 36 layer thicknesses are optimization variables, each bounded between 20 nm and 350 nm. Target: minimize average transmittance in 355-365 nm band, minimize average transmittance in 1030-1080 nm band, maximize average transmittance in 420-700 nm band. Use coherent transfer matrix method for spectral calculation.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Optimize the thicknesses of a 36-layer planar dielectric filter (alternating Ta2O5/SiO2, 18 pairs) on a fused silica substrate under normal incidence with unpolarized light. Minimize average transmittance in 355–365 nm and 1030–1080 nm bands while maximizing average transmittance in 420–700 nm. All layer thicknesses are free optimization variables bounded between 20 and 350 nm.",
